      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 1015,
      "width": 686.4,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "the flip to PENDING is the commit point.  everything before it is setup, and the Indexer\nignores AWAITING_UPLOAD rows entirely  \u2014  that is what makes it safe to write the row\n60 seconds before the bytes finish landing.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the flip to PENDING is the commit point.  everything before it is setup, and the Indexer\nignores AWAITING_UPLOAD rows entirely  \u2014  that is what makes it safe to write the row\n60 seconds before the bytes finish landing.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
