      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 530.4,
      "height": 243.75,
      "text": "each retry topic has its OWN consumer that waits before processing.\nretrying in place would hold the partition, block everything behind\nit, and eventually trip max.poll.interval.ms into a rebalance loop.\n\ntransient   ES 503, timeout, S3 throttle   ->  the ladder\npermanent   encrypted PDF, bad mime type   ->  FAILED now, 0 retries\n\njitter on every step, or every failure retries at the same instant\nand hammers the service that is trying to recover.\n\ntotal outage?  PAUSE the consumer instead of draining 50k messages\nthrough the ladder.  Kafka is the buffer  \u2014  that is its job.\n\na failed DELETE is worse than a failed index: the document stays\nfindable and nobody notices.  tag those separately and page on them.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "each retry topic has its OWN consumer that waits before processing.\nretrying in place would hold the partition, block everything behind\nit, and eventually trip max.poll.interval.ms into a rebalance loop.\n\ntransient   ES 503, timeout, S3 throttle   ->  the ladder\npermanent   encrypted PDF, bad mime type   ->  FAILED now, 0 retries\n\njitter on every step, or every failure retries at the same instant\nand hammers the service that is trying to recover.\n\ntotal outage?  PAUSE the consumer instead of draining 50k messages\nthrough the ladder.  Kafka is the buffer  \u2014  that is its job.\n\na failed DELETE is worse than a failed index: the document stays\nfindable and nobody notices.  tag those separately and page on them.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
